        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>报名和考试 - 可以自学吗</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] } };\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n    background: #eee;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 550px;\n    min-height: 733px;\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #dceefb 0%, #4a9fe8 20%, #2f7fd6 60%, #1f5fb0 100%);\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    padding: 30px 26px 40px 26px;\n    position: relative;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n\n  .title-box {\n    display: inline-block;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    border-radius: 22px;\n    padding: 10px 22px;\n    margin-bottom: 22px;\n    box-shadow: 0 3px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);\n  }\n  .title-box h1 {\n    margin: 0;\n    font-size: 22px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n\n  .title-box2 {\n    display: inline-block;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    border-radius: 22px;\n    padding: 10px 22px;\n    margin: 18px 0 20px 0;\n    box-shadow: 0 3px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);\n  }\n  .title-box2 h2 {\n    margin: 0;\n    font-size: 22px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n\n  .intro-text {\n    color: #ffffff;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    margin: 0 0 8px 0;\n  }\n\n  .body-text {\n    color: #ffffff;\n    font-size: 14.5px;\n    line-height: 1.85;\n    margin: 0 0 18px 0;\n  }\n\n  .highlight {\n    color: #f2c94c;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n\n  .illustrations {\n    position: relative;\n    margin-top: 20px;\n    height: 150px;\n  }\n\n  .placeholder {\n    position: absolute;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  .radial-diagram {\n    left: 0;\n    bottom: 0;\n    width: 190px;\n    height: 150px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);\n    font-size: 11px;\n    text-align: center;\n    border: 1px dashed rgba(255,255,255,0.3);\n  }\n\n  .bar-chart {\n    right: 10px;\n    bottom: 0;\n    width: 220px;\n    height: 130px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);\n    font-size: 11px;\n    text-align: center;\n    border: 1px dashed rgba(255,255,255,0.3);\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"title-box\">\n    <h1>报名和考试</h1>\n  </div>\n\n  <p class=\"intro-text\">\n    个人参赛，由所在中学进行统一报名；<br>\n    均为笔试考试，预赛为各省市自行组织、自主命题；<br>\n    剩余考试环节均为全国统一命题。\n  </p>\n\n  <div class=\"title-box2\">\n    <h2>可以自学吗？</h2>\n  </div>\n\n  <p class=\"body-text\">\n    1、<span class=\"highlight\">高中课本内容可以自学</span>，当然我们也有初高中基础知识课程，让你快速掌握竞赛考点。\n  </p>\n\n  <p class=\"body-text\">\n    2、一些难的知识点和不知道如何规划学习进度的时候，最好选择报课，大部分学生在有人一起学的情况下会比较好。<br>\n    有时候你以为自己自学的挺好，但是很多竞赛技巧、思维是需要老师来指导的。时间和钱，不能兼得。\n  </p>\n\n  <div class=\"illustrations\">\n    <div class=\"placeholder radial-diagram\">[Diagram: 手绘齿轮/放射状图案, 左下]</div>\n    <div class=\"placeholder bar-chart\">[Chart: 手绘柱状图, 右下]</div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
